# Step 7: Acceptance on dev
- After merge + green deploy: run the page's manual/e2e cases (bugs: the issue criteria) + short smoke. One issue comment listing cases passed/failed by id.
- Failure: bug issue linking the case id; parent stays open / В работе. Do not close the parent issue.
- Passed: run step 8 if Doc- is required (read `TA: Doc- after merge`); then set `статус: готово` and close the issue in the same moment (board-sync moves the card to Готово; never leave a closed issue with another status label). Do not move the Projects card by hand. A follow-up comment may note the merged PR; do not add `closes`/`fix`/`fixes` and do not call `addCloseIssueReferences` or add/remove Development links. After close, `.github/workflows/link-closed-by.yml` sets the PR chip. Carve-out for a hand move or a manual Development link: the owner explicitly asks. Feature: Готово when all subtasks are closed after their acceptance.
- The owner may spot-check major features; lead still owns the acceptance comment and the close.

## Epic acceptance (before epic Готово)
- When every child of an epic (`тип: родительская`) is Готово/closed, do **not** close the epic yet. Set the epic to `статус: на ревью`, summarize what shipped (features, Doc-/wiki links, how to check on dev), and ask the owner in chat to accept the epic as a whole.
- Owner pass: set `статус: готово`, close the epic, mark the wiki `Epic-` page «сделано» (step 8).
- Owner finds gaps: keep the epic `статус: в работе`; open new sub-issues under this epic and/or a new epic/feature as the owner directs; put them in Очередь and continue by Priority. Do not mark the epic Готово until a later owner pass.
- Epic end-to-end cases on the wiki page are the checklist for this conversation; child issue acceptance alone is not enough.
- After epic acceptance (or when the next Очередь item belongs to an epic not yet chosen): run epic pick with the owner (`playbook-workflow.mdc` «Epic pick and queue»; method in `project-github-formats.mdc` «Queue priority»). Propose the next epic or parallel set from the roadmap and wiki links; after confirm, set epic and child «Приоритет» accordingly.

## CI/CD wake
- After merge, set `Waiting on` = Deploy in the lead pipeline note (`/home/box/shared/travelagency/work/pipeline.md`). Do not create a per-task wait-watch routine and do not arm-then-check Actions for this task.
- When the durable routine «TravelAgency CI/CD» wakes on successful `Deploy to dev` for a sha that includes the merge, run this step.
- When this issue's remaining criteria live on a sibling issue, keep both open until joint acceptance; close them together (`playbook-workflow.mdc` related acceptance).
